  <text id="presentation-copy" x="72" y="306" width="490" height="142" font="body" size="19" color="muted" line-height="1.35"><p>• Default confirmed-data window</p><p>• Visible KPI cards</p><p>• Visible command-center panels</p><p>• Relative panel order</p></text>
